  <prompt>Apply the ADR-050 path B amendment the owner adopted in D-26, plus the companion doc fixes, in the main session (sub-agents cannot write .claude/).</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE architect. Amend narrowly; record what changed and why.</role>
  <goal>ADR-050 names WizardShell as the engine-bearing wizard preset, retires WizardModal, adds the in-app launch rule and the no-chrome-injection rule; the stale companion docs are corrected; a CHANGELOG entry exists.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>D-26 (spec section 9): adopt the canonical approach (SprkModal envelope + WizardShell engine, launched in-app; ADR-050 amendment = path B) and migrate today's wizards off navigateTo in this project. notes/modal-wizard-canonical-approach.md section 6 is the full conflict statement and draft. Root cause of the white header: navigateTo(webresource, target 2) draws Dataverse dialog chrome in the parent document, which Microsoft does not let us theme or hide; only an in-app mount avoids it. WizardModal has zero consumers; WizardShell has eight and owns its own envelope, violating ADR-050's MUST NOT on bespoke envelopes.</background>
    <relevant-files>
